1
00:00:00,426 --> 00:00:02,096
(camera clicks)

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:06,230
(Sheldon:)All you did was offer

3
00:00:06,232 --> 00:00:08,362
(Sheldon:)maternal care and affection,

4
00:00:08,367 --> 00:00:10,267
(Sheldon:)and all you received in return

5
00:00:10,269 --> 00:00:13,609
(Sheldon:)was rude and insensitive
behavior.

6
00:00:13,606 --> 00:00:15,706
(Penny:)Can this wait?

7
00:00:15,708 --> 00:00:17,178
(Sheldon:)I'm afraid it can't.

8
00:00:17,176 --> 00:00:18,346
(Sheldon:)The trip is tomorrow.

9
00:00:18,344 --> 00:00:20,144
(Leonard:)And I have
more apologies to make.

10
00:00:20,146 --> 00:00:22,446
(Penny:)Okay, fine, I accept
your apology, now get out!

11
00:00:22,448 --> 00:00:24,378
(Sheldon:)Wonderful. would you mind
holding up this shirt

12
00:00:24,383 --> 00:00:26,613
while I take a quick...?
Leonard!

13
00:00:29,488 --> 00:00:32,928
(Sheldon:)You brought me my comic books
when I wasn't feeling well.

14
00:00:32,925 --> 00:00:34,925
That-that was
thoughtful.

15
00:00:34,927 --> 00:00:36,097
(Sheldon:)And I was insensitive.

16
00:00:36,095 --> 00:00:37,525
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

17
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,130
(Stuart:)Thank you, Sheldon.

18
00:00:39,131 --> 00:00:40,901
(Leonard:)I appreciate that.

19
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,430
(Sheldon:)And I want you to know
that I mean it, you know?

20
00:00:43,435 --> 00:00:47,505
(Sheldon:)This isn't me just wanting to
go on the trip to Las Vegas.

21
00:00:50,342 --> 00:00:53,482
(Stuart:)What trip to Las Vegas?

22
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:55,449
(Sheldon:)The one everyone's taking

23
00:00:55,447 --> 00:00:57,947
(Sheldon:)this weekend on the party bus.

24
00:00:57,950 --> 00:01:00,380
(Stuart:)Of course, I wasn't invited.

